B.arS=s(["6414","Section3","Kyoto","\uad50\ud1a0","A city of west-central Honshu, Japan, north-northeast of Osaka. Founded in the eighth century, it has long been a cultural, artistic, and religious center. Kyoto was Japan's capital from 794 until 1869, although its political importance declined after the rise of the shoguns (1192) "],t.b)
