B.aoN=s(["6422","Section3","Miami","\ub9c8\uc774\uc560\ubbf8","A city of southeast Florida on Biscayne Bay south of Fort Lauderdale. Settled in the 1870s near the site of a fort built in 1836, it expanded greatly during the land boom of the 1920s and again after World War II "],t.b)
